@baseUrl = http://localhost:9080

### Health readiness, includes PostgreSQL readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Health liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi
Accept: application/yaml

### Query all memberships, default page size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=0

### Query all memberships with explicit page size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=0&size=20

### Query active memberships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE

### Query paused memberships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=0&size=20&status=PAUSED

### Query second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=1&size=20

### Invalid status filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/memberships?page=0&size=20&status=CANCELLED
